# This file will contain encrypted passwords
# Generate passwords using Hostinger's Password Protection tool or htpasswd command
#
# Format: username:encrypted_password
#
# INSTRUCTIONS TO GENERATE PASSWORDS:
#
# Method 1 - Using Hostinger (RECOMMENDED):
# 1. Go to hPanel > Files > Password Protect Directories
# 2. Select the /site directory
# 3. Create username and password
# 4. Hostinger will auto-generate this file
#
# Method 2 - Using online tool:
# 1. Visit: https://hostingcanada.org/htpasswd-generator/
# 2. Enter username: admin
# 3. Enter password: your_secure_password
# 4. Copy the generated line below
#
# Method 3 - Using command line (if available):
# htpasswd -c .htpasswd admin
#
# EXAMPLE (username: admin, password: Demo123!):
# admin:$apr1$8k7x9y5z$abc123def456ghi789jkl012

# Add your generated passwords below:
# username:encrypted_password_here
